    <string name="match_result_not_appropriate">Not an appropriate match right now</string>
    <string name="match_disclaimer">This only suggests whether your declared experience fits practical assessment for Assistant Electrician (CON/Q0602). It is not a certificate, pass, fail, or qualification — a human assessor makes the final decision after reviewing your practice evidence.</string>
